    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-TW-24",
      "boardId": "heiban-macos-quickstart-v3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5750,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 100,
      "rotation": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "zIndex": 24,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "05 · 平移、縮放與視角鎖定",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-TW-25",
      "boardId": "heiban-macos-quickstart-v3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5870,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 800,
      "rotation": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "zIndex": 25,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "滑鼠滾輪：以游標下的畫布位置為中心放大／縮小。\n中鍵按住拖曳：平移畫布。\n空白鍵＋左鍵拖曳：暫時平移，放開空白鍵回到原工具。\n觸控板：兩指平移，雙指捏合縮放。\n縮放鎖定：鎖定後避免操作時誤改視角；需要導覽時先解鎖。\n閱讀模式：瀏覽內容，避免誤畫或改物件。\n沉浸模式：由更多選單開啟，減少介面遮擋。\n編輯文字與便條紙時，滾輪只作用於文字編輯區；游標放回畫布後才縮放畫布。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-TW-26",
